    "source": "\n**Location:** `creator-production-tooling`\n\n**Frame:** One sentence from the notices is lifted out and set large, in their own register.\nBehind it, small and unemphasized, the two dates.\n\n**Screen / system text — STORED NOTICE (PARAPHRASED):**\n`THE SAFEGUARDS ARE INTENTIONALLY BROAD. BREADTH LETS US DELIVER CAPABILITY FASTER.`\n\n**Caption:**\n> THIS BOOK CALLS THAT A RACE AND MARKS IT AS ITS OWN ANALYSIS.\n>\n> HERE IT IS A PRODUCT NOTICE.\n\n**Provenance:** `documented` + `inferred` — `CI-REFUSAL`, both events, paraphrased. The\nvendor states the trade in its own words, twice, more than seven weeks apart. That this is the same\ntrade [page 097](097.md) bounds as project analysis is the project's observation.\n\n",
    "title": "The repeated notice wording stays in the tooling register"
  }
